    theorySections: [{"heading": "9. Pattern detail", "body": "Phase III bilan. In « Conditionnel advice · apply », lock the pattern by switching pronouns. Write six variants of the first focus line. Cover English and produce French from meaning alone."}, {"heading": "10. Spiral & Review", "body": "Pull one older tool into two new sentences. Finished lessons enqueue lemmas into Review. Repair with meaning + form — never plot."}, {"heading": "11. Dictionary & conjugations", "body": "Every meaningful reading/dialogue word needs a lemma. Multiwords count (*à bientôt*, *s'il vous plaît*). Open full tense sets from french-conjugations, not Présent-only stubs."}],
